comment author Shinryuu
comment Based on publication 4410 and our v4. Wily 4 from Shinryuu's unpublished run (room-33 Item 3 descent, Leaf Shield setup during the ceiling zip, hopping Boobeam Trap fight with 3 fewer lag frames; reconstructed and transplanted by atlas_w4_w6): Wily 5 starts 7 frames earlier. Wily 5 refights re-synchronised for the new $1C (Heat: 4 single-frame edits; Bubble/Quick/Metal: capsule-walk subpixels; Quick/Crash: RNG-only input swaps that keep every position and stale subpixel). 115 frames faster than publication 4410 in total.
